<title>USA: MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, MN 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange reported stocks of hard red spring wheat in deliverable position as of Oct 4, in 000 bushels. Stocks in exchange approved elevators deliverable against MGE futures. Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Oct 4    WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   MINNEAPOLIS AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,187   1,993   2,437</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				84	 8   1,220</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     21	21	34</p>
<p>Total					 2,292   2,022   3,691</p>
<p>						   DULUTH/SUPERIOR</p>
<p>Deliverable				 9,270   9,935  15,814</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     863   1,111   3,977</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    633     633     927</p>
<p>Total					10,766  11,679  20,718</p>
<p>Note: Minneapolis area includes Minneapolis/St Paul/Red Wing. (Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
